# The commits this repository builds on, one per line: NAME=<full commit
# hash>. The one place each is named; the workflows load this file with
# ashalkhakov/gnustep-release-actions/pins and .github/scripts/dependencies.sh
# reads it. Move a pin here and nowhere else.

# ashalkhakov/gnustep-patches: the fixes to GNUstep itself (libs-base,
# libs-gui, the Eau theme), applied to GNUstep's master as the stack is
# built. A commit, never a branch: CI's cache key is made of it, so a
# moving branch would keep serving a stack built from patches since
# changed. Moved from 610d60b, whose nsxml-prefixed-descendants no longer
# applies to libs-base (merged upstream as #821); this commit retires it.
# 7adc606 (#12): libs-base moved again, merging #843, the NSExpression
# FUNCTION and FETCH forms mapping models' source expressions need (so
# they now come from libs-base itself), and arc4random() on glibc before
# 2.36.
# 60de7bc (#14): libs-base merged #847 (plist-read-binary leaves) and moved
# past it, which had stopped every build of the stack from scratch;
# libs-gui merged #984 (xib-date-picker left, #13).
GNUSTEP_PATCHES_REF=60de7bcc1ce7744581acffdc5cd3f97512af19d1
